resolved formation marks, exact charged J_- preparation, compact transverse
vacuum/one-excitation input, fixed graph before the weak-field limit.
Results: actual input mean increment including occupied-B electric loss,
an explicit negative unrestricted increment and a positive low-band bound,
the actual selected adjoint-dissipator power and a proved vacuum baseline.
